WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:02.008
Soon, the government will exert

00:00:02.009 --> 00:00:03.839
unprecedented control over

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.789
what California doctors can say

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.409
to their patients about COVID-19.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:10.139
We got to stop the disinformation

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:10.739
pipeline.

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.289
Essentially, it puts the CDC

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:15.149
in the same room with the

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:16.679
doctor and the patient.

00:00:16.680 --> 00:00:18.599
Governor Gavin Newsom signed AB

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:20.459
2098 into law

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.199
this September and starting in the

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:24.419
New Year, doctors who disseminate

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:25.769
what the state defines as

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.049
misinformation or disinformation

00:00:28.050 --> 00:00:29.789
related to the SARS-CoV-2

00:00:29.790 --> 00:00:31.769
coronavirus can face

00:00:31.770 --> 00:00:33.659
disciplinary action by the

00:00:33.660 --> 00:00:36.059
California Medical Board, including

00:00:36.060 --> 00:00:38.609
being stripped of their licenses.

00:00:38.610 --> 00:00:41.129
These are doctors who are licensed

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:42.329
physicians who carry the same

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.039
license as I do, who provide

00:00:44.040 --> 00:00:46.589
legitimacy to disinformation.

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:48.449
It is essentially ends

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:50.369
your ability to to

00:00:50.370 --> 00:00:52.469
combat bad ideas

00:00:52.470 --> 00:00:54.329
put out by public health because

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.459
you have this this this looming

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:58.349
power over you

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.609
that essentially can end your

00:00:59.610 --> 00:01:00.509
career.

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.579
Stanford economist and medical

00:01:02.580 --> 00:01:04.439
school professor Jay

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:05.639
Bhattacharya was one of several

00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.499
scientists whose work NIH

00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:09.629
director Francis Collins said

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:11.549
needed a quick and devastating

00:01:11.550 --> 00:01:12.929
publish takedown.

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:14.879
In an email to Anthony Fauci that

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:17.369
was obtained through a FOIA request,

00:01:17.370 --> 00:01:18.629
Bhattacharya was one of the

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:20.159
scientists behind the Great

00:01:20.160 --> 00:01:21.989
Barrington Declaration, an

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:24.119
October 2020 open letter calling

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:25.679
for an immediate end to the

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:27.569
lockdowns and use of

00:01:27.570 --> 00:01:29.609
an alternative COVID-19 mitigation

00:01:29.610 --> 00:01:32.189
strategy called Focus Protection.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:34.049
Collins called Bhattacharya, who is

00:01:34.050 --> 00:01:35.729
a professor of medicine, economics

00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:37.949
and health policy at Stanford,

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:40.049
a fringe epidemiologist

00:01:40.050 --> 00:01:41.849
along with his cosigners, Harvard's

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:43.739
Martin Kulldorff and Oxford

00:01:43.740 --> 00:01:46.169
University's Dr. Sunetra Gupta.

00:01:46.170 --> 00:01:48.509
This kind of campaign essentially

00:01:48.510 --> 00:01:50.429
put the government in the role of

00:01:50.430 --> 00:01:53.069
of suppressing legitimate

00:01:53.070 --> 00:01:54.929
public policy debate, public

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:56.849
health debate about what the right

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.169
strategy ought to be.

00:01:58.170 --> 00:02:00.149
They put their finger on the scale.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.919
The idea was to create this illusion

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:04.499
of consensus around

00:02:04.500 --> 00:02:05.939
the lockdowns that didn't actually

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.799
exist, which was, I think,

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.388
quite dangerous and led to

00:02:09.389 --> 00:02:11.369
tremendous bad outcomes for

00:02:11.370 --> 00:02:12.569
people all around the world.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.049
I think it's very dangerous

00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:17.459
for public health to think that it

00:02:17.460 --> 00:02:19.649
has a monopoly on the truth.

00:02:19.650 --> 00:02:22.109
Bhattacharya says that same illusion

00:02:22.110 --> 00:02:24.119
of consensus is what California

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:25.979
lawmakers are leveraging to

00:02:25.980 --> 00:02:28.379
quash dissent among doctors

00:02:28.380 --> 00:02:30.149
across the entire state.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:31.529
The law defines COVID-19

00:02:31.530 --> 00:02:33.929
misinformation as medical advice

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.939
contradicted by contemporary

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.039
scientific consensus,

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:39.629
though, does not specify how to

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.069
define such a consensus.

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.929
Regardless of your views on the

00:02:42.930 --> 00:02:45.479
state of California's coronavirus

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:47.369
response policies or their public

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:48.809
health policies.

00:02:48.810 --> 00:02:50.579
I think any person left, right,

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:52.859
liberal, conservative who goes to

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:54.509
their physician and ask them a

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.099
question about COVID treatment or

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:58.019
COVID interventions wants

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:58.949
to actually know what their

00:02:58.950 --> 00:02:59.969
physician thinks.

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:01.739
They don't, no one wants a doctor

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:03.779
who's just reading from a script

00:03:03.780 --> 00:03:05.159
that was written by the California

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.589
Department of Public Health.

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:09.539
Aaron Kheriaty is a psychiatrist

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:11.339
and former professor who taught

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.109
bioethics at the University of

00:03:13.110 --> 00:03:15.599
California Irvine's Medical School.

00:03:15.600 --> 00:03:17.339
He was fired after he refused to

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:19.319
comply with the university's

00:03:19.320 --> 00:03:21.569
vaccine mandate and published

00:03:21.570 --> 00:03:23.969
an essay critical of the policy.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.229
He's also a co-plaintiff in a

00:03:25.230 --> 00:03:27.209
lawsuit filed by the new

00:03:27.210 --> 00:03:29.069
Civil Liberties Alliance,

00:03:29.070 --> 00:03:30.989
a nonprofit law firm that

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:33.029
views the administrative state as

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:35.039
an especially serious threat

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:37.679
to constitutional freedoms.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:39.659
The suit, which has yet to be heard,

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.789
is challenging the California law

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.679
on the grounds that it violates

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.229
free speech and due process rights.

00:03:46.230 --> 00:03:48.239
Science and censorship are,

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.039
in fact, incompatible.

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.929
The reason is that the

00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.999
scientific enterprise

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.889
precedes and makes progress and

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:58.199
moves forward by conjecture

00:03:58.200 --> 00:03:59.249
and refutation.

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:01.379
By generating a hypothesis

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:03.599
and doing a study to potentially

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:05.549
refute the hypothesis,

00:04:05.550 --> 00:04:07.199
it has to be an ongoing, open

00:04:07.200 --> 00:04:09.389
conversation where debate,

00:04:09.390 --> 00:04:11.039
where novel perspectives were

00:04:11.040 --> 00:04:13.139
challenges to orthodoxy

00:04:13.140 --> 00:04:14.969
or conventional thinking are not

00:04:14.970 --> 00:04:17.249
only permitted but welcomed

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:18.869
and then tested against the

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.369
empirical evidence.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.469
That's how science proceeds.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.299
So trying to fixate whatever

00:04:24.300 --> 00:04:26.879
the current consensus happens to be

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:28.829
and lock it in in law is

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:31.049
something that cannot be challenged

00:04:31.050 --> 00:04:32.050
by physicians,

00:04:33.150 --> 00:04:35.729
will stifle the progress of

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:36.539
science.

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:38.309
And that's obviously going to be a

00:04:38.310 --> 00:04:40.079
bad thing, not just for the practice

00:04:40.080 --> 00:04:42.239
of medicine, but for the advance

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:44.189
of medical science and the advance

00:04:44.190 --> 00:04:46.229
of treatment recommendations which

00:04:46.230 --> 00:04:48.119
need to be revised on an

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:49.799
ongoing basis, especially for a

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.719
novel illness like this that we're

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:53.159
still learning so much about.

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.989
The bills authors didn't reply to

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:56.639
our interview requests, but

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.649
Democratic Assemblyman Evan Low had

00:04:58.650 --> 00:04:59.709
this to say upon.

00:04:59.710 --> 00:05:01.389
Introducing the bill.

00:05:01.390 --> 00:05:03.429
The definition of misinformation is

00:05:03.430 --> 00:05:05.139
malicious intent.

00:05:05.140 --> 00:05:07.119
It is very specific,

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.079
very direct.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.759
And it's important that we help

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.799
allow the California Medical Board

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:13.569
to have these definitions in place

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.489
to ensure the integrity of

00:05:15.490 --> 00:05:17.379
our health care system and provide

00:05:17.380 --> 00:05:19.989
an opportunity to save lives.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:21.939
What would you say is the

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:24.069
proper role of

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:25.059
a medical board?

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:27.489
How does it effectively identify,

00:05:27.490 --> 00:05:29.379
you know, cranks or quacks who are

00:05:29.380 --> 00:05:31.299
legitimately harming their

00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:31.989
patients?

00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.519
So that's a great question.

00:05:33.520 --> 00:05:35.089
It's not an easy question.

00:05:35.090 --> 00:05:37.719
Legally, I will I will admit that.

00:05:37.720 --> 00:05:39.639
But historically and as medical

00:05:39.640 --> 00:05:41.349
boards have functioned really up

00:05:41.350 --> 00:05:43.419
until the pandemic,

00:05:43.420 --> 00:05:45.339
as far as I have seen,

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.309
is that they tend to give physicians

00:05:48.310 --> 00:05:50.169
very wide discretionary

00:05:50.170 --> 00:05:52.539
latitude to make specific

00:05:52.540 --> 00:05:54.309
medical judgments.

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:57.549
The law in California specifies

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:59.619
that the medical board cannot

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:01.599
discipline physicians, for example,

00:06:01.600 --> 00:06:03.519
for engaging in complementary or

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:05.949
alternative medical practices

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.689
so long as they have some level of

00:06:07.690 --> 00:06:09.639
evidence to support

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.409
them. So you can do things in

00:06:11.410 --> 00:06:13.629
medicine that are outside

00:06:13.630 --> 00:06:15.909
of the allopathic mainstream,

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.229
and the medical board cannot

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.489
discipline you.

00:06:18.490 --> 00:06:20.439
And that's good for that's

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:22.479
good for patients who want to seek

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:24.399
out medical providers that are

00:06:24.400 --> 00:06:25.400
doing things

00:06:26.290 --> 00:06:28.089
that maybe a little bit outside of

00:06:28.090 --> 00:06:29.499
the mainstream.

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.389
Now, those those doctors

00:06:31.390 --> 00:06:33.279
have a duty to give the patient the

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:34.119
information.

00:06:34.120 --> 00:06:34.929
This is what we know.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:35.889
This is what we don't know.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:37.749
This is the evidence or the lack

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:38.319
of evidence.

00:06:38.320 --> 00:06:40.359
If doctors are practicing medicine

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:41.979
that harms patients.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.019
Malpractise laws protect patients

00:06:44.020 --> 00:06:45.429
against that.

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.379
Those those laws are are

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.089
completely legitimate in my eyes.

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.159
This law, what it does

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.649
is prevents doctors from

00:06:53.650 --> 00:06:55.989
dissenting against reigning

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:58.149
ideas in public health, even

00:06:58.150 --> 00:06:59.649
when public health is wrong.

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:01.299
Governor Gavin Newsom added a

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:03.249
signing statement that this

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.379
bill does not apply to any

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.419
speech outside of discussions

00:07:07.420 --> 00:07:09.639
related to COVID 19 treatment

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:11.679
within a direct physician patient

00:07:11.680 --> 00:07:12.729
relationship.

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:14.649
But Bhattacharya says supporters of

00:07:14.650 --> 00:07:16.719
the law hoped to use it to silence

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.609
doctors on social media.

00:07:18.610 --> 00:07:20.529
The lawsuit alleges that one of

00:07:20.530 --> 00:07:22.329
the groups that lobbied for the law,

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.549
No License for Disinformation,

00:07:24.550 --> 00:07:26.439
whose representatives didn't reply

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:28.599
to our interview request, regularly

00:07:28.600 --> 00:07:30.729
threatened him and other dissenting

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:32.469
physicians in the lead up to the

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.419
law's passage with a member

00:07:34.420 --> 00:07:35.619
of the group tweeting at one

00:07:35.620 --> 00:07:36.699
plaintiff.

00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:38.529
I look forward to reporting

00:07:38.530 --> 00:07:40.539
you to your medical board once

00:07:40.540 --> 00:07:42.429
a certain law is passed in

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:43.389
California.

00:07:43.390 --> 00:07:45.309
When we reached out, he told us that

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.409
I hope the suit gets tossed and

00:07:47.410 --> 00:07:49.029
they all deserve to lose their

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:50.439
licenses.

00:07:50.440 --> 00:07:51.639
Why did they attack me?

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.319
Well, it's not because I'm posing

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:54.219
any risk to patients.

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:55.179
I don't care for patients.

00:07:55.180 --> 00:07:56.649
I do research full time.

00:07:58.330 --> 00:08:00.159
They attacked me because that the

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:02.049
the idea of the law, the

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:03.999
real purpose of the law is to

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.099
limit dissent against

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.049
public health generally by

00:08:08.050 --> 00:08:10.029
authoritative figures,

00:08:10.030 --> 00:08:11.649
especially doctors.

00:08:11.650 --> 00:08:12.999
During testimony in favor of the

00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.619
bill, the founder of No License for

00:08:14.620 --> 00:08:16.449
Disinformation pointed to

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.459
a physician practicing medicine,

00:08:18.460 --> 00:08:20.289
but to a group of doctors who held a

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:21.879
press conference.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.559
A group of physicians calling

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:24.789
themselves America's Frontline

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:26.199
Doctors, led by a licensed

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:27.849
California physician named Simone

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:28.850
Gold,

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.229
held a press conference

00:08:32.230 --> 00:08:35.408
in what can only be called the most

00:08:35.409 --> 00:08:37.029
prolific public showing of

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.709
disinformation to date.

00:08:38.710 --> 00:08:40.298
If you've gotten the virus, there's

00:08:40.299 --> 00:08:41.079
treatment.

00:08:41.080 --> 00:08:42.548
That's what we're here to tell you.

00:08:42.549 --> 00:08:44.229
Regardless of how one feels about

00:08:44.230 --> 00:08:45.789
the message put forth by this

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:47.709
particular group of doctors,

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:49.389
Bhattacharya says that mentioning

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:50.859
them during the debate of the bill

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:52.779
is evidence that the target is

00:08:52.780 --> 00:08:55.029
not only physicians in practice,

00:08:55.030 --> 00:08:58.089
but any public dissent from doctors.

00:08:58.090 --> 00:09:00.099
Although the letter of the law

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.929
may say, Just let's limit what

00:09:01.930 --> 00:09:03.399
happens in patient rooms, even

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:04.569
that's bad enough, as we've already

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:05.499
discussed.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.359
In fact, the effect of the law

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:09.219
will be to suppress

00:09:09.220 --> 00:09:11.169
free discussion by doctors

00:09:11.170 --> 00:09:13.119
who are afraid of losing the license

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:14.469
if they disagree with public health

00:09:14.470 --> 00:09:15.909
online and elsewhere.

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.469
The rationale written into the text

00:09:17.470 --> 00:09:19.539
of the law is that COVID-19

00:09:19.540 --> 00:09:21.039
has claimed millions of lives

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:22.689
worldwide, including tens of

00:09:22.690 --> 00:09:24.609
thousands in California, and

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:26.319
that the safety and efficacy

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:28.149
of COVID-19 vaccines has been

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:30.069
confirmed through evaluation by

00:09:30.070 --> 00:09:31.239
the Federal Food and Drug

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:32.139
Administration.

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.269
It's plausible to say that it was

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.339
true at one time,

00:09:36.340 --> 00:09:38.289
but as the virus has evolved

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.359
and has as time has gone on

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:42.039
and we have more distance from the

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.869
time of vaccination to

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.759
the infection, that that claim may

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:48.219
not be as true anymore.

00:09:48.220 --> 00:09:50.229
That reasoning also ignores

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.209
the fact that a

00:09:52.210 --> 00:09:54.099
doctor's recommendation has

00:09:54.100 --> 00:09:56.049
to be tailored to the needs of

00:09:56.050 --> 00:09:57.909
this specific patient in front

00:09:57.910 --> 00:09:59.199
of me. So the.

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:01.119
All or nothing claim that vaccines

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.259
are safe and effective

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:06.099
glides over the very

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.229
significant, for example,

00:10:08.230 --> 00:10:10.479
age stratified differences

00:10:10.480 --> 00:10:12.969
in the risks and benefits of

00:10:12.970 --> 00:10:15.309
the vaccine glides over

00:10:15.310 --> 00:10:17.559
the significant risk and benefit

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:18.939
difference between someone who's

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.739
never had COVID and someone who's

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:22.959
already had COVID and has natural

00:10:22.960 --> 00:10:23.979
immunity.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:25.959
So it's not necessarily

00:10:25.960 --> 00:10:28.209
the case that

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.429
a doctor who's recommending

00:10:30.430 --> 00:10:32.319
the vaccine for an 80 year old

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.239
with diabetes would also

00:10:34.240 --> 00:10:36.849
want to recommend the same vaccine

00:10:36.850 --> 00:10:38.859
for a six year old or a 16

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:40.749
year old or even a 26

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:42.939
year old. A law like this doesn't

00:10:42.940 --> 00:10:45.069
take account of that aspect

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:46.899
of medical care that needs

00:10:46.900 --> 00:10:48.729
to be individualized to the

00:10:48.730 --> 00:10:49.928
patient.

00:10:49.929 --> 00:10:51.459
Kheriaty says that this law is the

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.409
latest example of a trend

00:10:53.410 --> 00:10:55.779
towards an increasingly centralized

00:10:55.780 --> 00:10:57.729
bureaucratic health system

00:10:57.730 --> 00:10:59.559
that prioritizes control

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.539
and surveillance over individual

00:11:01.540 --> 00:11:03.669
patient needs, a topic he covers

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:05.619
at length in his book, The New

00:11:05.620 --> 00:11:06.489
Abnormal.

00:11:06.490 --> 00:11:08.379
The subtitle is The Rise of the

00:11:08.380 --> 00:11:10.149
Biomedical Security State, which is

00:11:10.150 --> 00:11:11.259
kind of the melding of public

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:12.849
health, digital technologies of

00:11:12.850 --> 00:11:14.799
surveillance, and police powers of

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:17.259
the state. The laws or the

00:11:17.260 --> 00:11:18.969
or the regulations that are

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.829
governing the practice of medicine

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.749
and governing people's lives at ever

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:23.799
more subtle levels.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.149
Even though a lot of these policies

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.799
have been rolled back, I don't think

00:11:26.800 --> 00:11:28.629
we've seen the last of of

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.249
this kind of movement in this

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.539
direction.

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.069
And I think a big part of that is

00:11:33.070 --> 00:11:34.929
going to be increasingly

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:38.139
sort of squeezing and compromising

00:11:38.140 --> 00:11:39.579
physicians, what I call before

00:11:39.580 --> 00:11:41.469
physicians, discretionary latitude

00:11:41.470 --> 00:11:43.449
there, their ability to make patient

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:45.729
specific judgments, their ability

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:47.799
to to think and to practice

00:11:47.800 --> 00:11:49.809
medicine according to their best

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.309
judgment, according to their own

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.589
interpretation of research

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:54.999
in the medical literature, according

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.649
to their own clinical experience.

00:11:57.970 --> 00:11:59.199
I worry that doctors are

00:11:59.200 --> 00:12:01.089
increasingly going to become

00:12:01.090 --> 00:12:03.129
functionaries in a larger

00:12:03.130 --> 00:12:05.769
sort of public health apparatus

00:12:05.770 --> 00:12:07.329
that doesn't know how to

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.579
individualize care to the needs of

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.409
specific patients, but takes this

00:12:11.410 --> 00:12:13.569
kind of all or nothing approach

00:12:13.570 --> 00:12:16.149
to managing a problem like COVID.

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:18.549
What are some of the best ways to

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:20.589
either reverse or

00:12:20.590 --> 00:12:22.809
at least halt that to

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:25.659
escape the new abnormal.

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:27.729
We need to end the declared state

00:12:27.730 --> 00:12:29.409
of emergency at the federal level

00:12:29.410 --> 00:12:30.909
and at the state levels.

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:32.319
So here in California, we're still

00:12:32.320 --> 00:12:33.369
operating under a state of

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.109
emergency, which gives Governor

00:12:35.110 --> 00:12:37.269
Newsom and his appointed

00:12:37.270 --> 00:12:39.279
public health officials, unelected

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:40.839
officials, extra constitutional

00:12:40.840 --> 00:12:42.279
powers that they wouldn't otherwise

00:12:42.280 --> 00:12:44.469
have outside of the emergency.

00:12:44.470 --> 00:12:45.939
President Biden announced a month or

00:12:45.940 --> 00:12:47.379
so ago on 60 Minutes that the

00:12:47.380 --> 00:12:49.329
pandemic was over, which was

00:12:49.330 --> 00:12:50.859
true. In fact, it's been over for

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:52.419
quite some time.

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:54.729
But many of his advisers immediately

00:12:54.730 --> 00:12:56.319
panicked and said, no, no, no, you

00:12:56.320 --> 00:12:57.549
can't say that.

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:59.799
The reason they panicked is

00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.719
if it's true that

00:13:01.720 --> 00:13:03.909
the pandemic is over, then

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:05.439
the state of emergency, the federal

00:13:05.440 --> 00:13:07.059
state of emergency, which is renewed

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:09.519
by HHS Secretary

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:10.959
Xavier Becerra with the endorsement

00:13:10.960 --> 00:13:12.369
of the president and has been

00:13:12.370 --> 00:13:13.869
renewed every three months for the

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:15.699
last three years, almost,

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:16.839
that will have to end.

00:13:16.840 --> 00:13:18.969
And when that happens, the

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:20.950
128 additional extra-constitutional

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.309
powers that the president gains

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:25.539
during this declared a state of

00:13:25.540 --> 00:13:26.829
emergency will have to be

00:13:26.830 --> 00:13:27.939
relinquished.

00:13:27.940 --> 00:13:30.219
And the powers that HHS

00:13:30.220 --> 00:13:32.199
and its its agencies

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.059
like the CDC, FDA, NIH

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:35.919
gain will also have

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:36.849
to be relinquished.

00:13:36.850 --> 00:13:39.189
The emergency use authorizations

00:13:39.190 --> 00:13:41.109
of the vaccines no longer apply

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:42.249
if we're not under a state of

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:43.209
emergency.

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:45.159
The Pfizer and Moderna vaccines

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:47.079
are fully FDA approved for

00:13:47.080 --> 00:13:49.239
adult use, but an emergency

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.129
use authorization still covers

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.109
use among minors.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.269
Kheriaty also favors decentralizing

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:57.459
research funding so that less

00:13:57.460 --> 00:13:58.959
of it is directed by federal

00:13:58.960 --> 00:14:00.909
officials like Anthony Fauci

00:14:00.910 --> 00:14:02.679
and Francis Collins at the National

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:04.689
Institutes of Health, who can make

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.429
or break the career of a scientist

00:14:06.430 --> 00:14:08.529
by funding or denying them grant

00:14:08.530 --> 00:14:09.729
money. The lawsuit against

00:14:09.730 --> 00:14:11.979
California was filed in November

00:14:11.980 --> 00:14:13.929
and has yet to be heard by a judge.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.699
If no ruling is issued in the coming

00:14:15.700 --> 00:14:18.069
weeks, AB 2098

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:20.439
will become California law

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:22.119
starting January 1st.

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:23.769
The fundamental problem is the loss

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:25.419
of authority in public health

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.039
because they have squandered their

00:14:27.040 --> 00:14:29.859
authority to correct the record

00:14:29.860 --> 00:14:31.869
rather than being honest

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.549
about what was known and not known.

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.439
Calling for more studies when

00:14:35.440 --> 00:14:37.149
they're needed to resolve these

00:14:37.150 --> 00:14:37.989
uncertainties.

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:39.999
Public health should not rule over

00:14:40.000 --> 00:14:41.349
the public. Public health should be

00:14:41.350 --> 00:14:43.299
partners with the public in

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:44.529
promoting health.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:46.239
I think humility would be the

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:47.589
watchword in my reformed public

00:14:47.590 --> 00:14:48.590
health.

